<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     LEGEND    x=40..320
     AMBIENT   x=40..320 (below legend; clears skip bus)
     LEFT      x=400..720 — skip / create-only / ENDs
     SPINE     x=780..1160 — gate → create / update path
     RIGHT     x=1240..1620 — update + diagram attach region

     BUSES (exclusive; miss every solid vertex AABB):
       x=360   skip → END drain (west gutter; ≥40px from ambient + left)
       x=1200  intent → update/diagram (spine|region gutter)
       x=1680  create ↔ attach climb (east)

     Uniform spine gaps 40px; left nodes align to sibling spine y.
     Region children inset ≥40px.
     Edge meaning chips are separate cells — not mid-stroke labels.
-->
